{
  "id": "ISA.54",
  "number": "54",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaya 54",
  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "54",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 54"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "54",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ozine iwe mugumba, atakazaraga mwana; iwe mukazi atakarumwaga otere empundwi, ozine akanyahwera. Kuba Omukama nagamba okwo omukazi anagirweho iba aragira abaana bangi kushaga aina iba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enju yawe ogihanguhye, emiguha y'epazia ogileege, n'emishumare yayo ogitere egume, epazia otekemu ezihango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi yona eraba yawe, baijukuru bawe tuliba bakama b'amahanga, n'ebigo ebili ndaara babijure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otatina kuba tolikwija kuba kantu; oshemelerwe, oshanduke kuba tobe kantu. Enaku ezo waboine oli muto waija kuzebwa, n'okujumwa tokijumwa ngu oli ntumbwakazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omutonzi wawe n'iwe aba baro, eibaralye ni Mukama w'amahe. Omutakatifu wa Isiraeli n'iwe aba muchunguzi wawe, bamweta Ruhanga w'ensi yona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isiraeli, Omukama yakwegarukamu nk'omukazi omujune anagirainye iba, yakwegarukamu nk'omukazi muto owo mushaijawe abaire abingire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama omuchunguzi wawe nagamba ati, “Mbaire nkuhoiremu akanya kake, kyonkai ndakugilira embabazi nkugarure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbandize nakunigalira ekiniga kingi eibanga ligufi, nakwesheleka, kyonkai aha rw'engonzi zanga ez'eirai lyona ndakugilira embabazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba amakiro aga niganshusira amakiro aga Noa: Okwo nanahiire okwo omutunga gwa Noa gutalishuba kumaraho nsi, nikwo nanahiire kutakunigalira anga kukukunganisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amabanga n'enshozi byakuhwaho, kyonkai inye tindilekera kukugilira kisha, kandi tindichwa ndagano yange ey'emilembe. Inye Omukama akugilira embabazi n'inye ndikukugambira ekigambo eki.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iwe Yerusalemu omushashe, omuyaga nigukwiy'oku nigukunag'oku, iwe kigo ekitagira wa kukimaramara, leba amabare gawe ninyija kugatonaho amabara garungi, n'emisingi yawe ngyombekese safiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eminara yawe ndagyombekesa kalukedoni, kandi ebihigi mbyombekese karubunko, kandi enkuta zona nzombekese amabare g'eiguzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana bawe bona Omukama aliba mwegesa wabo, mara tuligoshoka babe ruranganwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oliba mugorogoki ogume; taliho aliziza kukubonesa naku, kuba toliyuguuma, n'obutini tolibumanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu alikutatulira inye ndiba ntabulimu; kandi alikwenagaho alisingwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuhesi ajuguta omuliro n'inye namutonzire, omuhesi ahesha ekikwato omu ngeli yakyo. N'omwisherukare akatondwa inye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 54:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai taliho kikwato kyobahesire kukwita kilikwita, kandi abakuhagika bona olibasinga.” Abairu bange ndibemera basinge, alikugamba n'inye Omukama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.54.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.54.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
